{"detail": {"templateUuid": "85b6bcaa41054f8db5de3c80477a4d70", "projectUuid": "4ac3c891a6f440a4bb5e27fb921573e4", "name": "《赴约卅年》中式物哀美学短片", "description": "极致中式武侠美学🍂走破三十年风雪，只为赴一场空约。 《赴约卅年》中式美学AIGC短片。\n极致中式物哀武侠美学🍂三十年风雪只为赴一场空约。\n黄沙咽下铁锈，岁月掩埋长风。\n这江湖，终究只是一场大雪。\n这是我一直以来的一个想法，只是最近空下来才有时间去尝试。历时不短也不长，完成了这部纯粹的武侠视觉短片。 没有炫目的魔法，没有快意恩仇，只有漫长的岁月和最极致的孤独。\n从江南的烟雨石桥，到中原的银杏落叶； 从极寒的苍茫雪原，到瀚海的赤色黄沙。 我们用镜头记录下了一个剑客三十年的旅途。\n其实很多时候，我们执着的早就不是某个人，或者某件事， 而是那个当年站在紫禁之巅，意气风发的自己。\n如果你也喜欢这种克制、苍凉、带有后摇质感的中式浪漫，，戴上耳机，慢慢体验。", "coverUrl": "/assets/970734000f361e2d.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/ea845bc2267c4c1aa6df5099a6da594c/3f4072387c479a252363c5c74da45f625813f18c.mp4", "snapshotId": 25533, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 3990772, "ownerUuid": "ea845bc2267c4c1aa6df5099a6da594c", "avatar": "/assets/9efbeeb0f2cc394c.webp", "nickname": "Dave", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 73, "tags": [{"id": 1201, "code": "short_series", "tagLabel": "短片剧集", "parentTag": 1200, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1200/1201/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 1, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}, {"id": 1202, "code": "style_aesthetic", "tagLabel": "风格美学", "parentTag": 1200, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1200/1202/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 2, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}], "userTags": [{"tagId": 5002, "name": "专业", "icon": "/assets/a31a6cc391430f72.webp", "primaryIcon": "/assets/7097b07d2df12cc8.webp", "desc": "LibTV专业作者", "verifyLevel": 2}], "score": 0, "socialMediaUrl": "https://www.douyin.com/user/self?from_tab_name=main&modal_id=7660143254024785195&showTab=post", "createAt": "2026年07月09日 11:28", "updateAt": "2026年07月14日 17:51", "publishAt": "2026年07月09日 11:28", "playCount": 19, "viewCreationProcessCount": 6, "copyCanvasCount": 2, "shareCount": 0, "snapshotPath": "/data/canvas-snapshots/85b6bcaa41054f8db5de3c80477a4d70.json.gz", "snapshotSummary": {"nodes": 142, "edges": 204}}, "recommendList": []}